  "conclusion": "The C24.1 <-> C26.2 gap is a SINGLE-FILE GATE and Net-(U12-PS_SYNC) owns it.  A pad bridge there is a barrier across the only corridor into the U12 north-west pocket at 0.200 mm on every layer this net may use, so the SYS rail's C26.2 island and the PS_SYNC haul are MUTUALLY EXCLUSIVE there.  The pad-bridge blame screen's EVICTABLE verdict was a work-list entry and is correct as one: the eviction is legal, the RELAY it owes is not.",
